# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The repo root is served as the public site (see .vercelignore), so anything
# committed here is fetchable at its own URL. These are working artifacts that
# must never become pages.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Design-tool bundler exports. Single self-unpacking HTML files that inline
# their own fonts and rewrite the document on load. They are reference material
# for porting, never inputs to the build. intake-updated.html is the reason this
# file exists: it is a complete second intake form wired to the live CRM
# webhooks, and one `git add -A` would have published it.
intake-updated.html
NeuroSage Family Section.html

# Local-only prototypes, already excluded from deploy but never ignored by git.
prototype.html
app-preview.html
app-prototype/

# Scratch and tooling
mockups/
.claude/
